sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User (Dashboard/Mobile)
    participant CS as Chat Service (chatbot module)
    participant G as Guardrail Middleware
    participant LLM as LLM Provider (Ollama/Hosted)
    participant TR as Tool Router
    participant API as Internal Read API (/api/v1, tenant-scoped)
    participant DB as Postgres (RLS by tenant_id/site_id)

    U->>CS: "Xe tôi đang ở đâu?" + JWT (tenant_id, site_id, role, sub)
    CS->>G: Rate-limit check (Redis, keyed by tenant_id)
    G-->>CS: OK (within Plan.limits.chatbot_messages_per_month)
    CS->>LLM: system prompt + tenant context + tool schema + user message
    LLM-->>CS: tool_call getVehicleLocation(plate="51A-12345")
    CS->>TR: execute(tool="getVehicleLocation", args, jwtContext)
    Note over TR: tenant_id/site_id/role always injected<br/>from JWT context, never from LLM args
    TR->>API: GET /api/v1/vehicles/51A-12345/location
    API->>DB: SELECT ... WHERE tenant_id = :jwtTenant (RLS enforced)
    DB-->>API: slot_id=B12, occurred_at=09:35, snapshot_id
    API-->>TR: 200 OK {slot: "B12", lastSeenAt: "09:35", snapshotId}
    TR-->>CS: tool result (JSON)
    CS->>G: PII / cross-tenant post-filter
    G-->>CS: result passes guardrails
    CS->>LLM: tool result appended to context
    LLM-->>CS: "Xe 51A-12345 đang ở ô B12, ghi nhận 09:35"
    CS->>API: GET /api/v1/snapshots/{snapshotId}
    API-->>CS: snapshot object_url (signed, tenant-scoped)
    CS-->>U: answer text + snapshot thumbnail
